										"Events": [],
										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# OSK-3 Account Register (excerpt)\r\n\r\n- **Guest**\r\n  - Username: Guest\r\n  - Password: accessUICS\r\n  - Note: Public bulletins. No write access.\r\n\r\n- **Quartermaster**\r\n  - Username: Quartermaster\r\n  - Password: Harbor#Ware4\r\n  - Note: Logistics directory. Warehouse stock, harbor and vehicle maintenance.\r\n\r\n- **Admin**\r\n  - Username: Admin\r\n  - Note: Credential withheld from this register by order of Port Command (Directive 7-P). Ask the duty quartermaster for the current rotation.",
											"$ns": "[2C9853E6E633F3D3F51C087FCE244600]",
