										"Events": [],
										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# PORT BULLETIN â€“ OUTSKIRTS\r\n\r\nEffective immediately:\r\n\r\n1. Curfew on the harbor road runs 21:00â€“05:00. Anyone moving between the ports and the coastal apartments after curfew is stopped and searched.\r\n2. The processing plant is still under construction. There is next to no cover on the site. Do not cross it in daylight.\r\n3. The locked warehouses at the old quay belong to VCUP and the old IGC. Leave them shut. They are not ours to open.\r\n4. The resort is VLF ground. Patrols turn back at the beach road.\r\n5. Aircraft over the island are IGC traffic for the airstrip. Do not engage unless fired upon.\r\n6. Ration distribution for the coastal apartments moves to the small village hall on Thursdays.\r\n\r\nThe western money is gone, but the ports still matter. Hold them.",
											"$ns": "[2C9853E6E633F3D3F51C087FCE244600]",
											"$key": "36E3D2114ADEBE44654480B455062FA5"
										}
									}
								]
							}
						}
