											"$text": "WAREHOUSE,ITEM,QTY,UNIT,STATUS\r\nUICS Warehouse 1,Ration Packs,1340,pcs,OK\r\nUICS Warehouse 1,Diesel,4200,L,OK\r\nUICS Warehouse 2,Petrol,900,L,LOW\r\nUICS Warehouse 2,Medical Kits,85,pcs,OK\r\nUICS Warehouse 4,Ammunition 5.56,0,crates,EMPTY â€“ theft reported 03/11\r\nUICS Warehouse 4,Boat Engine Parts,6,crates,OK\r\nBike Shop (village road),Chains / Tyres / Tools,â€”,lot,REQUISITION PENDING\r\nComms Building,Generator Fuel,240,L,AWAITING ESCORT\r\n\r\n> Warehouse 4 losses exceed tolerance for the third week. The locked IGC warehouses next door show fresh tyre tracks. Recommend a night watch on the quay.",
