										"Events": [],
										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# HARBOR & NODE MAINTENANCE LOG â€“ OSK-3\r\n\r\n[02/11 06:40] Harbor gate barrier motor replaced. Hydraulics still leaking.\r\n[02/11 14:15] Patrol boat UICS-P-07 returned with a fouled intake. Grounded.\r\n[03/11 09:02] Node OSK-3 rebooted after the power cut. Admin account reset by signals.\r\n              Temporary admin credential issued to the duty officer: Admin / UICS@Outskirts-7\r\n              REMINDER: rotate before the next inspection. (Still not rotated â€“ QM)\r\n[04/11 18:30] Comms Building generator down to its last filter. Fuel waiting in the store, needs an escort up the hill.\r\n[05/11 07:55] Dish on the Comms Building realigned. Uplink to the coastal network restored.\r\n[06/11 11:20] Bike shop on the village road is untouched. Sent a list of parts we can use.",
											"$ns": "[2C9853E6E633F3D3F51C087FCE244600]",
