										"Events": [],
										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# PORT COMMAND DIRECTIVE 7-P (COPY)\r\n\r\nOutskirts was meant to be the forefront of western expansion. That stalled with the war, but the ports are still the only door to the island the UICS controls. They are to be held until relieved.\r\n\r\nThe Comms Building complex is the key position on the island. Every UICS signal on Outskirts goes through it. It is to be held at all costs.\r\n\r\nPatrols are not to enter the resort (VLF) or approach the airstrip (IGC). Contact with either is reported directly to Port Command, not over the open net.\r\n\r\nThe full coastal defense plan is stored on this node. Do not print it, do not transmit it.",
											"$ns": "[2C9853E6E633F3D3F51C087FCE244600]",
