											"$text": "Document Title: \"INTERCEPT 0711 â€“ Resort Net\"\r\nDate: 2024-12-02\r\nClassification: Top Secret â€“ Signals\r\n\r\nDecryption with Defense key A complete. Preview of recovered traffic:\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\"[02:14] RESORT-1: Shipment lands at the airstrip Thursday. IGC take their cut, we take the rest.\r\n[02:15] HUT-3: Then we store it in the locked warehouses on the quay. The old VCUP keys still work.\r\n[02:17] RESORT-1: Good. Port watch changes at 05:00. Don't cross the processing plant, there's no cover. Go through the village.\r\n[02:18] HUT-3: And the comms building?\r\n[02:18] RESORT-1: Last. Once it goes dark, the ports are deaf.\"\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\nAnalysis: a VLF cell from the resort is using the nature huts as a forward post and moving goods through the IGC airstrip into the locked VCUP/IGC warehouses next to our own. The end goal is the Comms Building.\r\n\r\nFull intercept secured for Port Command.",
