										{
											"$text": "# PATROL ROSTER â€“ WEEK 44 (ARCHIVED)\r\n\r\nHarbor Gate ............ Squad Kestrel (day) / Squad Heron (night)\r\nUICS Warehouses ........ Squad Marten (day) / understrength (night)\r\nCoastal Apartments ..... Squad Kestrel, 10:00 daily\r\nComms Building ......... Signals detachment, escort on request\r\n\r\n> Squad Heron was reassigned to the Quarry on 29/10. The night watch on the warehouses has run short since.",
