										"Events": [],
										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "# CIVIL NOTICE â€“ FERRY SERVICE (ARCHIVED)\r\n\r\nResidents of the coastal apartments and the small village may leave the island on the civilian ferry from the ports between 06:00 and 18:00 with a valid ration card.\r\n\r\nDepartures through the airstrip are not available to civilians.\r\n\r\nThis notice was withdrawn on 01/11. Civilian departures are suspended until further notice.",
